{"about_the_game":"Explore a handcrafted tower, seek out its secrets and find new spells to conquer your enemies.<br><br>Wisdom Tower aims to be a retro metroidvania, focused on exploration and puzzle solving. A heavy inspiration for the game is <i>Doriath</i> for the Commodore 64, and a misc of other games I love.<br><br>My major design goals are<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Encourage drawing a map with traditional methods, but also make it easy to keep track of where things are mentally.<br></li><li> Ensure that combat stays less skill focused, instead each encounter should provide a mini puzzle.<br></li><li> Non linearity by opening up most of the map early on, letting the players choose their own path.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3086020?t=1767623730","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767623730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086020/3bec20e2467f0c82e226af338acf9bbdf6dd6260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767623730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086020/3bec20e2467f0c82e226af338acf9bbdf6dd6260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767623730","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4275960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Explore a handcrafted tower, seek out its secrets and find new spells to conquer your enemies.<br><br>Wisdom Tower aims to be a retro metroidvania, focused on exploration and puzzle solving. A heavy inspiration for the game is <i>Doriath</i> for the Commodore 64, and a misc of other games I love.<br><br>My major design goals are<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Encourage drawing a map with traditional methods, but also make it easy to keep track of where things are mentally.<br></li><li> Ensure that combat stays less skill focused, instead each encounter should provide a mini puzzle.<br></li><li> Non linearity by opening up most of the map early on, letting the players choose their own path.</li></ul>","developers":["Luminight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086020/1045995665c226e084340ed55735ea2e13311b90/header.jpg?t=1767623730","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086020/304395262/ad2ef7332bac52e235b9e11663db6d7fe360b9ce/1766521811/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767621871","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086020/304395262/ad2ef7332bac52e235b9e11663db6d7fe360b9ce/1766521811/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767621871","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086020/304395262/ad2ef7332bac52e235b9e11663db6d7fe360b9ce/1766521811/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767621871","id":257254750,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257254750/38cb0639e808ec3e850a47be57405cabc8ff194a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767621871"}],"name":"Wisdom Tower","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Luminight"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol